@page "/relax"
@rendermode InteractiveServer

<PageTitle>Relax – ESIR</PageTitle>

    <p>
        Tell ESIR how you feel, or try one of the exercises below when things feel too fast. They take a few minutes
        and nothing you do here is saved. You don't need to do them all. Pick what feels right.
    </p>

<section>
    <h2>How do you feel?</h2>
    <p>Pick a feeling and ESIR will answer.</p>
    <FeelingPicker />
</section>

<section>
    <h2>Breathe slowly</h2>
    <p>Follow the circle. When it grows, breathe in. When it shrinks, breathe out. Slow breaths can help your body calm down.</p>
    <BreathingExercise />
</section>

<section>
    <h2>Two quick exercises</h2>
    <div class="pair">
        <StepExercise Title="Look around: 5-4-3-2-1"
                      Intro="A way to come back to the here and now, using your five senses."
                      Steps="_grounding" />
        <StepExercise Title="Let go of tension"
                      Intro="Tighten, then soften, one part of your body at a time."
                      Steps="_release" />
    </div>
</section>

<section class="care">
    <h2>Good to know</h2>
    <ul>
        <li>These exercises are for everyday stress and for slowing down. They are not medical treatment.</li>
        <li>If breathing exercises make you dizzy, stop and breathe normally.</li>
        <li>If you are in danger or feel very unwell, contact your local emergency number or someone you trust.</li>
    </ul>
</section>